#: scenario5:scenario5_231177F8_A960_411F_BAD4_D4A6BF6A7379
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 592479befb38acc10ee0c29a4c3defa54c3ed3b80d21800562b3e1c835279fd1
