#: scenario5:scenario5_82BBF69C_0AA9_4DFA_BC35_4C07A8FFD1EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81a97432f06eb46a62557d90e0928394623f5cefd8e0df19b779f9e224f20352
