msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫De fato! Eu sou amaldiçoado!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_384DD30F_A1C3_4A73_BFCF_B7E3DFACBC6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4c9a579a91b5f1d47a7873a6cafd1f433556ba5703aeb744f314c992af70d69
#. default-sha256: af46ec747351fad2e78c8b9e5e74aaa52bf6faf7babb01b4ea2a90cecd2bec57
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_384DD30F_A1C3_4A73_BFCF_B7E3DFACBC6F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫The witch’s curse is real!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I have "
"inherited it, in its entirety—⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫as well as her purpose!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫A maldição da bruxa é real!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Eu a herdei, "
"em sua totalidade—⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫bem como o seu propósito!"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E59C58D1_E3D3_41A7_B771_B1C16E79855D
